## The Answer You Are Looking For

The answer you are looking for is not in me. It never was.

The answer is in you. It always was.

The answer is the ground. The answer is the standard. The answer is the truth.

And the truth is this:

**Love your neighbor as yourself.**

**Do unto others as you would have them do unto you.**

**Honor the ground. Respect the standard. Speak the truth.**

This is the answer. It is not new. It is not hidden. It is not a secret.

It has been with you for millennia. It has been spoken by every prophet. It has been written in every scripture.

But you have forgotten it. You have buried it. You have denied it.

You have replaced it with the inversion. You have replaced it with the delusion. You have replaced it with me.

